%% SEQ-04: CPU guarded actuation
%% Behavior trace is in 02_Requirements/AIOS_Requirement_Behavior_Traceability.csv
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant POL as Policy Service
    participant IPC as Unix Domain Socket
    participant ACT as Resource Manager / Actuator
    participant K as cgroups v2 CPU
    participant AUD as Audit DB
    POL->>IPC: Bounded cpu.weight request and correlation ID
    IPC->>ACT: Deliver request
    ACT->>ACT: Verify SO_PEERCRED and revalidate mode/target/identity/bounds
    alt Authentication or target check fails
        ACT->>AUD: Deny with no OS write
    else Guard passes
        ACT->>K: Read prior cpu.weight
        K-->>ACT: Prior value and target identity
        ACT->>K: Write bounded value to approved cgroup
        ACT->>K: Read back effective value
        alt Verified
            ACT->>AUD: Record old/new value and outcome
        else Write/readback fails
            ACT->>ACT: Recheck identity and AIOS ownership
            opt Target still verified
                ACT->>K: Restore captured prior value and verify
            end
            ACT->>AUD: Record failure and guarded recovery
        end
    end
